WEBVTT

01:37.570 --> 01:42.840
[Spring of The Blade]

01:43.660 --> 01:45.780
[Episode 14]

01:50.590 --> 01:51.710
Where is the money?

01:52.920 --> 01:54.430
I asked you, where is the money?

01:54.430 --> 01:55.150
Money?

01:55.280 --> 01:56.539
There's no more money.

02:09.000 --> 02:11.200
-Are you all right, Lord Wei?
-Lord Wei.

02:18.750 --> 02:20.910
What a brilliant scheme, My Lord.

02:22.030 --> 02:24.560
This move is very exquisite.

02:25.190 --> 02:27.470
On one hand, you quelled the disaster.

02:27.590 --> 02:28.650
On the other hand,

02:28.750 --> 02:30.480
you forced the grain merchants

02:30.590 --> 02:32.120
to lower their prices.

02:33.840 --> 02:35.470
Lord Yan, you really

02:36.000 --> 02:38.800
have Hengtang in the palm of your hand.

02:39.390 --> 02:43.760
But I am a little worried
about Your Lordship.

02:44.470 --> 02:46.240
The situation in the future

02:46.960 --> 02:49.280
will probably be difficult to control.

02:51.710 --> 02:53.560
I haven't thought about that.

02:54.120 --> 02:57.079
No matter what the situation is
in the future,

02:57.430 --> 02:58.870
I must thank Lord Xie.

02:59.750 --> 03:01.630
If not for your secret help,

03:02.240 --> 03:04.040
I couldn't have pulled this off.

03:04.360 --> 03:06.150
I will definitely go
to the capital in the future

03:06.150 --> 03:08.120
and put in a few good words for you.

03:09.910 --> 03:10.870
Thank you.

03:12.240 --> 03:13.120
Lord Xie,

03:13.560 --> 03:17.560
aren't you going with me to see
how grandly the disaster relief is going?

03:17.590 --> 03:18.470
Lord Yan,

03:19.070 --> 03:20.400
as you can see,

03:21.280 --> 03:22.310
Shu

03:22.680 --> 03:24.480
has family matters to deal with,

03:25.030 --> 03:26.670
so he asked for a day off.

03:27.680 --> 03:30.240
You'd better go back first.

03:30.710 --> 03:31.710
Qingyuan,

03:32.280 --> 03:33.280
see the guest out.

03:34.680 --> 03:35.280
Yes.

03:57.130 --> 04:01.260
♪ I counted every moment ♪

04:01.280 --> 04:05.370
♪ Memories take roots;
the annual rings grow ♪

04:05.390 --> 04:09.910
♪ Who bore the parting wind ♪

04:09.940 --> 04:14.670
♪ And wove it gently into the warmth
of the past? ♪

04:14.770 --> 04:18.870
♪ I honor every scar upon your hand ♪

04:15.360 --> 04:16.310
Your Lordship,

04:17.240 --> 04:18.950
Everyone says you are a corrupt official,

04:18.890 --> 04:23.280
♪ Through endless nights,
a lone soul wanders this mortal world ♪

04:19.430 --> 04:20.560
but I never expected

04:20.920 --> 04:22.190
that today you would

04:22.750 --> 04:24.390
save countless starving people
in Hengtang,

04:23.300 --> 04:29.960
♪ Turning back, we embrace—
one fleeting moment of love and hate ♪

04:24.750 --> 04:25.810
and save me as well.

04:26.510 --> 04:28.750
I genuinely admire Your Lordship.

04:29.680 --> 04:32.430
From now on, wherever Your Lordship goes
to listen to music,

04:30.030 --> 04:33.650
♪ As flowers fall beneath the dusk ♪

04:32.830 --> 04:34.390
drink with courtesans, or spend money,

04:33.680 --> 04:39.190
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

04:34.630 --> 04:35.630
if you're willing,

04:35.630 --> 04:36.270
-I—
-What?

04:39.220 --> 04:43.780
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

04:43.680 --> 04:45.000
What did you say I'd spend money on?

04:43.800 --> 04:47.980
♪ In the depths of darkness,
you are the stars ♪

04:48.010 --> 04:52.580
♪ Trample the abyss, together we run ♪

04:50.870 --> 04:52.600
Thank you for saving me today,
Your Lordship.

04:52.600 --> 04:57.050
♪ May we grow deep in years together,
sharing one life and one pillow ♪

04:57.080 --> 05:01.560
♪ Rise and fall as one,
whether we're united or apart ♪

05:01.590 --> 05:06.030
♪ Hand in hand,
we brave all the storms of life ♪

05:06.050 --> 05:11.570
♪ Never to part, forevermore ♪

05:07.600 --> 05:09.530
It's not safe in Hengtang tonight.

05:10.000 --> 05:11.000
If I'm not around,

05:11.950 --> 05:13.800
you must protect yourself.

05:34.630 --> 05:36.120
Bad news, Master!

05:37.040 --> 05:38.430
Master, bad news!

05:39.870 --> 05:40.530
Chuntai...

05:40.950 --> 05:42.080
stopped breathing.

05:43.150 --> 05:44.000
Master...

05:45.190 --> 05:48.680
I gave birth to two sons
for the Xie family,

05:49.870 --> 05:52.430
and I raised Zhenglun so well.

05:52.430 --> 05:54.560
Yet you say I'm faking it.

05:55.510 --> 05:59.040
Why couldn't Xie Qingyuan
be the one faking it?

06:01.240 --> 06:04.720
-I didn't kill anyone.
-Mother, please get up.

06:04.720 --> 06:07.480
You're bullying me!

06:07.480 --> 06:08.310
Enough.

06:08.950 --> 06:11.010
Things outside are annoying enough.

06:11.040 --> 06:12.720
As for how your matter should be handled,

06:12.720 --> 06:15.120
Master and Old Madam will decide.

06:15.390 --> 06:17.270
Aren't you the Head Madam?

06:18.720 --> 06:20.180
You can make the decision.

06:21.240 --> 06:22.000
Yes.

06:23.360 --> 06:24.720
Everyone, calm down.

06:24.800 --> 06:25.610
Donglin.

06:26.310 --> 06:28.080
What is Wei Changyan

06:28.510 --> 06:29.560
up to?

06:30.160 --> 06:31.390
I sent someone to investigate,

06:31.390 --> 06:32.590
but there's no reply.

06:32.750 --> 06:33.360
However,

06:33.920 --> 06:35.680
I heard the east pier
is in chaos right now—

06:35.680 --> 06:37.880
the grain merchants
are making a scene.

06:42.120 --> 06:43.270
Listen to me.

06:44.600 --> 06:47.390
Without my permission today,

06:47.870 --> 06:50.610
no one is allowed to
step out of the residence.

06:50.680 --> 06:51.390
Yes!

06:53.600 --> 06:54.870
Calm down, everyone!

06:56.040 --> 06:57.120
Calm down!

06:57.120 --> 06:58.310
Please listen to me!

06:58.310 --> 06:58.840
Lord Wei.

06:59.430 --> 07:00.310
Our ships

07:00.310 --> 07:01.870
have been docked here
for over half a month!

07:01.870 --> 07:03.510
If you don't buy our grain now,

07:03.510 --> 07:04.510
what are we supposed to do?

07:04.510 --> 07:06.040
Exactly, what should we do?

07:06.430 --> 07:07.430
What should we do?

07:09.160 --> 07:10.560
How are we supposed to live?

07:10.560 --> 07:12.270
The grain collection
was agreed to be today.

07:12.270 --> 07:13.750
Why are you giving grain away instead?

07:13.750 --> 07:14.630
A bunch of evil officials!

07:14.630 --> 07:15.270
Liars!

07:15.380 --> 07:16.380
-Liars!
-Liars!

07:16.430 --> 07:17.600
That's a big claim!

07:19.510 --> 07:21.040
You're speaking nonsense!

07:21.430 --> 07:22.830
H-How dare you!

07:24.600 --> 07:25.830
Insolent commoners!

07:26.240 --> 07:27.160
Outrageous!

07:27.800 --> 07:28.480
Bastards!

07:32.270 --> 07:33.750
Outrageous, really.

07:38.950 --> 07:40.000
Lord Wei,

07:40.240 --> 07:41.430
where are you going?

07:41.870 --> 07:42.950
Isn't it time to pay

07:43.390 --> 07:44.920
the profit you promised me?

07:45.830 --> 07:46.560
Sir,

07:46.680 --> 07:47.940
you don't understand.

07:48.040 --> 07:48.770
There must be

07:49.150 --> 07:50.680
some misunderstanding here.

07:50.680 --> 07:52.480
Go back and wait for me for a few days.

07:52.480 --> 07:55.210
I will definitely give you
an explanation, okay?

07:55.630 --> 07:57.040
We agreed on today,

07:58.600 --> 07:59.800
so it must be today.

08:00.190 --> 08:00.680
But...

08:03.120 --> 08:05.360
the price difference
for these 1,800 dan of grain,

08:05.360 --> 08:07.420
even if you kill me, I can't afford it.

08:36.750 --> 08:38.000
Help!

08:38.919 --> 08:39.919
Help!

08:46.390 --> 08:47.270
Guards!

08:47.440 --> 08:48.360
Guards!

08:48.720 --> 08:49.630
You guys go this way

08:49.630 --> 08:51.030
and block the front door!

08:51.120 --> 08:52.840
The rest, follow me this way!

08:54.240 --> 08:55.910
Mother, what's going on?

08:55.910 --> 08:57.030
I don't know.

08:57.030 --> 08:58.240
With the city tower drums
beating like that,

08:58.240 --> 08:59.750
if they weren't collecting grain
in the middle of the night,

08:59.750 --> 09:02.880
I would have thought
they were crying out my grievances.

09:02.960 --> 09:03.720
What's going on?

09:03.720 --> 09:04.520
I have no idea.

09:04.790 --> 09:05.550
Master!

09:05.960 --> 09:06.480
Father!

09:06.480 --> 09:07.320
Master!

09:07.600 --> 09:08.150
Father!

09:08.320 --> 09:08.920
Master...

09:10.240 --> 09:11.120
Old Madam!

09:11.390 --> 09:12.120
Nanny Liu.

09:12.120 --> 09:12.910
Old Madam!

09:13.550 --> 09:14.480
What is going on?

09:14.600 --> 09:16.030
It's complete chaos outside.

09:16.030 --> 09:18.360
These northern bandits
have reached the outer city!

09:18.360 --> 09:20.670
They specifically target wealthy families.

09:20.670 --> 09:21.960
They say the northern bandits...

09:21.960 --> 09:23.790
They kill any men they see,

09:24.000 --> 09:25.400
and as for women, they...

09:35.000 --> 09:36.150
What should we do?

09:36.150 --> 09:36.790
Don't be afraid.

09:36.790 --> 09:37.650
Mother is here.

09:37.870 --> 09:39.440
Don't be afraid. It's okay.

09:39.440 --> 09:40.970
Father and Mother are here.

09:41.600 --> 09:42.330
Don't panic.

09:42.600 --> 09:43.240
Stay calm!

09:43.790 --> 09:44.390
Yuejian,

09:45.270 --> 09:47.200
put out all unnecessary lights first

09:47.200 --> 09:49.200
so we don't attract
the bandits' attention.

09:49.200 --> 09:49.840
Yes.

10:01.120 --> 10:03.120
Good thing you prepared in advance.

10:03.150 --> 10:04.960
Trouble really arrived today.

10:05.630 --> 10:06.890
I'm more curious about

10:07.550 --> 10:08.960
how these northern bandits

10:08.960 --> 10:11.020
managed to break through so smoothly

10:11.390 --> 10:12.790
and reach the outer city.

10:14.390 --> 10:16.000
Who cares how they broke in?

10:16.510 --> 10:17.910
We must kill the bandits,

10:17.910 --> 10:20.370
but all the more must Wei Changyan
be killed.

10:20.600 --> 10:21.930
I've waited for 9 years,

10:22.630 --> 10:24.430
and I don't want to wait anymore.

10:25.600 --> 10:27.330
Where do you think that scumbag

10:27.480 --> 10:29.150
could be hiding?

11:21.080 --> 11:21.720
Lord Yan!

11:26.960 --> 11:28.510
I don't care what my father thinks.

11:28.510 --> 11:29.150
If he won't help you,

11:29.150 --> 11:29.790
I will.

11:30.120 --> 11:31.440
In the past, I only thought

11:31.440 --> 11:33.040
you were a corrupt official.

11:33.150 --> 11:34.480
Only today did I realize

11:34.720 --> 11:36.050
you bore all that infamy

11:36.240 --> 11:38.170
to protect the people of Hengtang.

11:38.600 --> 11:41.000
I absolutely won't stand by
and do nothing.

11:41.270 --> 11:43.270
We will protect the people with you.

11:48.150 --> 11:48.870
Report!

11:50.080 --> 11:52.080
The northern bandits have reached
the outside of the south gate!

11:52.080 --> 11:52.810
Understood.

11:54.390 --> 11:55.200
Pei Guanling,

11:55.750 --> 11:57.480
notify all major city gates
to defend strictly.

11:57.480 --> 11:58.390
Do not let a single bandit

11:58.390 --> 11:59.750
slip through.

12:00.120 --> 12:00.650
Yes, sir.

12:06.720 --> 12:07.440
Soldiers!

12:08.000 --> 12:08.790
Now,

12:09.080 --> 12:11.210
the time has come to prove yourselves.

12:11.360 --> 12:13.440
Please follow me to wipe out the bandits

12:13.440 --> 12:15.370
and defend the people of Hengtang.

12:17.670 --> 12:18.390
Kill them!

12:18.720 --> 12:19.520
-Kill!
-Kill!

12:19.600 --> 12:20.360
-Kill!
-Kill!

12:20.360 --> 12:21.200
-Kill!
-Kill!

12:21.270 --> 12:22.070
-Kill!
-Kill!

12:57.870 --> 12:58.550
Mother,

12:58.550 --> 12:59.720
I'm scared.

12:59.720 --> 13:00.550
Don't be afraid,

13:00.550 --> 13:01.680
your father is here.

13:04.200 --> 13:05.390
Master, bad news!

13:05.630 --> 13:06.360
Master!

13:06.360 --> 13:07.360
Master, bad news.

13:07.510 --> 13:08.110
Master...

13:08.240 --> 13:09.670
-What are you panicking for?
-Master...

13:09.670 --> 13:10.750
Speak slowly.

13:11.150 --> 13:11.960
Master,

13:12.440 --> 13:13.360
the northern bandits...

13:13.360 --> 13:15.220
they have attacked the East Gate.

13:15.320 --> 13:17.080
They are burning, killing,
and looting everywhere,

13:17.080 --> 13:18.910
and will be here soon.

13:18.910 --> 13:20.200
What should we do?

13:27.360 --> 13:27.840
Mother!

13:27.840 --> 13:29.370
What are you panicking for?

13:31.270 --> 13:32.800
With the patriarch around,

13:33.240 --> 13:34.700
what's there to panic for?

13:36.870 --> 13:37.630
Nanny Liu,

13:38.270 --> 13:39.150
keep an eye out.

13:39.480 --> 13:40.940
If there is any situation,

13:40.960 --> 13:42.290
report it immediately.

13:42.320 --> 13:43.390
Yes, Madam.

13:46.320 --> 13:47.270
Master...

13:52.870 --> 13:53.720
Master,

13:54.440 --> 13:57.900
why not ask the government office
to send troops to protect us?

13:58.790 --> 14:00.440
It's chaos outside.

14:00.840 --> 14:02.320
The government office has few soldiers.

14:02.320 --> 14:04.200
They can hardly protect themselves.

14:04.200 --> 14:04.750
Then...

14:05.720 --> 14:06.980
Then what should we do?

14:12.240 --> 14:13.640
The Marquis' residence—

14:13.720 --> 14:14.850
they have soldiers.

14:15.440 --> 14:16.170
First Madam,

14:16.320 --> 14:19.120
aren't you close
with the Marchioness of Danyang?

14:19.550 --> 14:20.280
How about...

14:20.390 --> 14:22.250
I don't have that much influence.

14:27.120 --> 14:27.840
However,

14:29.480 --> 14:31.480
to ask of the Marquis' residence...

14:35.510 --> 14:36.480
I'm afraid

14:38.000 --> 14:39.460
only Fourth Lady can do it.

14:45.150 --> 14:46.120
That's right.

14:47.030 --> 14:50.030
Not only did they take a liking
to Qingyuan,

14:50.510 --> 14:53.170
she also has a close relationship
with Lord Yan.

14:53.390 --> 14:55.150
For her sake,

14:55.360 --> 14:57.890
they probably wouldn't sit by
and do nothing.

15:01.200 --> 15:01.910
Mother,

15:02.320 --> 15:03.980
it's full of bandits outside.

15:04.510 --> 15:05.720
Who knows where

15:05.840 --> 15:07.240
Lord Yan and the heir is?

15:07.670 --> 15:08.790
Yet you're asking
a weak lady like her to...

15:08.790 --> 15:10.120
Who told you to speak? Sit down.

15:10.120 --> 15:10.720
All right,

15:11.080 --> 15:11.880
stop talking.

15:14.120 --> 15:14.870
Right now,

15:16.030 --> 15:19.150
even if we mobilize soldiers
from all the residences,

15:20.080 --> 15:22.270
distant water can't put out a nearby fire.

15:22.270 --> 15:24.530
The personal guards of the Xie Residence

15:24.550 --> 15:26.630
have just left for the Northern Frontier.

15:26.630 --> 15:28.480
It seems this is the only way.

15:28.910 --> 15:29.750
Qingyuan.

15:30.840 --> 15:31.440
See if...

15:32.630 --> 15:33.750
you can risk

15:34.200 --> 15:35.660
going to the Yan residence

15:35.720 --> 15:37.720
to ask Lord Yan for reinforcements.

16:13.550 --> 16:14.240
Kill!

16:22.000 --> 16:22.510
Hurry!

16:28.360 --> 16:29.240
I know

16:30.910 --> 16:32.440
I shouldn't ask a weak lady like you

16:32.440 --> 16:35.320
to risk your life for something like this.

16:36.000 --> 16:37.440
But the Xie family...

16:44.840 --> 16:45.550
Never mind.

16:46.750 --> 16:47.720
Forget it.

16:49.840 --> 16:50.670
Mother.

16:52.360 --> 16:53.390
I am unfilial.

16:53.720 --> 16:55.360
Last Lantern Festival,

16:55.790 --> 16:56.790
I had a dream.

16:57.910 --> 17:00.790
In the dream, a boy sang:

17:01.000 --> 17:04.640
"All flowers fade during the full moon."

17:05.160 --> 17:06.480
It seems this prophecy

17:07.720 --> 17:09.270
is coming true today.

17:10.030 --> 17:14.310
Alas, the century-old foundation
of our Xie family

17:15.319 --> 17:16.829
is coming to an end.

17:27.790 --> 17:28.830
Qingyuan.

17:29.400 --> 17:30.930
If it weren't an emergency,

17:31.000 --> 17:33.060
I wouldn't want you to take this risk.

17:33.310 --> 17:35.350
I wish I could take your place.

17:36.030 --> 17:37.750
But right now, only you

17:38.200 --> 17:39.680
can save the Xie family.

17:40.110 --> 17:41.440
Are you willing to go?

17:41.680 --> 17:42.960
We can talk about other things

17:42.960 --> 17:44.760
after we survive this disaster.

17:46.550 --> 17:47.240
Mother.

17:48.070 --> 17:49.310
It's too dangerous.

17:51.590 --> 17:52.200
I will go.

17:56.790 --> 17:57.680
My Lady.

17:57.920 --> 17:58.790
Stay here.

17:59.550 --> 18:00.880
Don't cause me trouble.

18:14.510 --> 18:15.910
But I have one condition.

18:16.440 --> 18:18.240
After the bandit rebellion is quelled,

18:18.240 --> 18:19.310
my mother's case

18:20.200 --> 18:22.260
must be thoroughly reinvestigated.

18:28.440 --> 18:29.480
No one

18:30.790 --> 18:32.070
is allowed to refuse.

18:41.350 --> 18:42.200
All right.

18:43.960 --> 18:44.750
As long as

18:45.960 --> 18:47.590
you're willing to save the Xie Residence,

18:47.590 --> 18:49.400
we'll agree to any request.

18:52.550 --> 18:53.240
Old Madam.

18:55.110 --> 18:55.920
Master?

19:01.110 --> 19:02.640
I'll go with Fourth Sister.

19:03.310 --> 19:03.960
Nonsense!

19:04.240 --> 19:05.500
What are you going for?

19:06.030 --> 19:06.750
Qingyuan.

19:07.510 --> 19:08.970
For the sake of the family,

19:09.270 --> 19:10.830
please make the trip.

19:12.400 --> 19:13.240
Zhenglun,

19:13.510 --> 19:15.170
take good care of your sister.

19:17.240 --> 19:17.880
Yes.

19:18.550 --> 19:19.940
If anything happens to her,

19:19.940 --> 19:21.070
I won't forgive you!

19:21.640 --> 19:22.200
Yes!

19:23.550 --> 19:24.200
Qingyuan.

19:26.880 --> 19:28.140
We're counting on you.

19:29.270 --> 19:30.310
Be careful.

20:59.350 --> 21:00.880
Close the city gates!

21:05.510 --> 21:06.710
Close the city gates!

21:06.750 --> 21:08.550
Stop the bandits from escaping!

21:29.070 --> 21:29.960
After them!

22:19.680 --> 22:20.280
Over here!

22:20.400 --> 22:20.920
Here!

22:21.030 --> 22:21.640
Quick!

22:22.070 --> 22:22.550
Quick!

22:24.590 --> 22:25.250
Chase them!

22:25.550 --> 22:26.110
Stop!

22:26.310 --> 22:26.910
Don't run!

22:28.400 --> 22:29.110
Stop!

22:30.200 --> 22:30.920
This way!

22:31.640 --> 22:32.770
Thank you, Brother.

22:33.400 --> 22:34.480
You are willing to take risks

22:34.480 --> 22:36.680
to seek help for the Xie family—
a great act of righteousness.

22:36.680 --> 22:37.830
But I always believe

22:38.270 --> 22:41.000
that my mother
didn't kill anyone on her own will.

22:42.960 --> 22:44.290
Please, Fourth Sister,

22:44.830 --> 22:46.090
don't blame my mother.

22:49.400 --> 22:50.110
Over here!

22:51.880 --> 22:52.880
Go find Lord Yan.

22:54.200 --> 22:55.030
What about you—

22:55.030 --> 22:55.770
Go!

23:03.070 --> 23:03.730
Go quickly!

24:32.640 --> 24:33.200
Che!

24:37.720 --> 24:39.180
I think I saw Wei Changyan.

24:44.830 --> 24:45.720
Lord Yan!

24:48.160 --> 24:48.720
Lord Yan!

24:48.880 --> 24:50.400
There's a riot in the east of the city.

24:50.400 --> 24:51.550
What about the Xie Residence?

24:51.550 --> 24:52.480
The Xie Residence is fine.

24:52.480 --> 24:53.340
I just heard...

24:53.750 --> 24:54.410
Heard what?

24:54.640 --> 24:57.700
They asked Fourth Lady
to seek help from Your Lordship.

24:57.750 --> 24:58.480
Where is she?

24:58.480 --> 24:59.240
Not sure yet.

25:03.830 --> 25:05.270
The enemy is right in front of you,

25:05.270 --> 25:06.960
and you're still thinking about
that woman?

25:06.960 --> 25:08.890
Do you really think you're Yan Rui?

25:16.960 --> 25:17.590
Che.

25:18.550 --> 25:19.880
Wait for me to come back.

25:25.400 --> 25:25.930
Brother!

25:27.790 --> 25:28.440
Shen Run!

25:48.510 --> 25:49.370
Your Lordship!

25:49.550 --> 25:50.410
Your Lordship!

25:50.610 --> 25:51.420
General!

25:51.750 --> 25:53.920
I am Qingyuan, the fourth daughter
of the army inspector Xie family.

25:53.920 --> 25:55.180
My family is in danger!

25:55.440 --> 25:57.300
Please save them, Your Lordship!

25:57.590 --> 25:58.400
My Lord!

25:58.640 --> 25:59.350
My Lord!

26:00.590 --> 26:01.400
My Lord!

26:02.480 --> 26:03.350
No shouting!

26:03.830 --> 26:06.480
Closing the city gates is to prevent
bandits from sneaking in.

26:06.480 --> 26:07.270
Why?

26:07.270 --> 26:08.400
Exactly! Why?

26:18.440 --> 26:19.070
Your Lordship.

26:19.070 --> 26:20.160
I am the fourth daughter of

26:20.160 --> 26:21.350
the army inspector
Xie Residence of Hengtang.

26:21.350 --> 26:24.410
My family is trapped.
Please save them, Your Lordship.

26:31.590 --> 26:32.750
I didn't bring any money,

26:32.750 --> 26:34.080
only this jade pendant.

26:34.200 --> 26:36.200
Please do me a favor, Your Lordship.

26:37.510 --> 26:38.360
We heed the imperial decree!

26:38.360 --> 26:39.960
We heed the imperial decree!

26:47.480 --> 26:48.210
Fourth Lady.

26:51.270 --> 26:52.240
Master Pei!

26:53.440 --> 26:54.350
My eldest brother...

26:54.350 --> 26:55.350
He's surrounded by bandits.

26:55.350 --> 26:56.110
Go save him!

26:56.110 --> 26:58.710
He's in the third alley
on the street behind us.

27:00.030 --> 27:00.640
Follow me!

27:09.750 --> 27:10.480
Fourth Lady.

27:10.830 --> 27:11.890
This jade pendant,

27:12.110 --> 27:13.370
where did it come from?

27:16.070 --> 27:17.440
Lord Yan gave it to me.

27:17.590 --> 27:19.390
Do you recognize it, Master Pei?

27:19.480 --> 27:21.410
Put the jade pendant away quickly.

27:23.310 --> 27:24.720
This is an imperially bestowed

27:24.720 --> 27:25.550
pass.

27:25.730 --> 27:27.270
From the Imperial Throne Room

27:27.270 --> 27:28.790
down to the imperial guards,

27:28.790 --> 27:30.030
anyone holding this token

27:30.030 --> 27:31.510
will have all doors opened for them,

27:31.510 --> 27:32.960
passing without hindrance.

27:32.960 --> 27:34.220
If it weren't wartime,

27:34.310 --> 27:36.110
I would have to speak to you on my knees.

27:36.110 --> 27:36.960
Lord Yan

27:37.270 --> 27:38.400
is really generous.

27:45.440 --> 27:46.700
We'll form an alliance

27:47.990 --> 27:49.250
and share weal and woe.

27:57.680 --> 27:59.550
So you treat what I gave you

28:00.480 --> 28:01.510
as a mere toy.

28:02.400 --> 28:03.930
Anyway, it's all just stuff

28:05.070 --> 28:06.800
that was forced on me by others.

28:09.200 --> 28:11.730
I really don't think
I need that jade pendant.

28:17.240 --> 28:18.570
Then listen carefully.

28:20.000 --> 28:21.110
You will need it.

28:45.350 --> 28:46.070
Master Pei,

28:46.550 --> 28:47.880
take me to find Lord Yan.

29:34.310 --> 29:35.030
Master Pei!

29:35.590 --> 29:36.480
Master Pei!

29:37.350 --> 29:38.440
Lord Yan is in the west of the city,

29:38.440 --> 29:40.440
surrounded by a large group of bandits.

29:40.440 --> 29:41.350
What did you say?

29:41.350 --> 29:42.200
What happened to Yan Rui?

29:42.200 --> 29:44.070
When Master Shen's reinforcements arrived,

29:44.070 --> 29:45.830
there were only dozens of corpses
on the ground.

29:45.830 --> 29:47.230
There were no survivors.

29:47.240 --> 29:48.170
Where is Yan Rui?

29:48.880 --> 29:50.480
We're identifying the bodies.

29:50.480 --> 29:51.400
Lord Yan's survival

29:51.400 --> 29:52.310
is unknown.

29:52.920 --> 29:56.050
But I heard there are no survivors
in the west of the city.

29:56.160 --> 29:57.270
Lord Yan may have…

29:57.270 --> 29:57.880
Shut up!

29:59.160 --> 29:59.890
Find him now!

30:00.070 --> 30:00.720
Yes!

30:07.580 --> 30:14.470
♪ Spring comes to the long gate,
green grass sprouts ♪

30:08.510 --> 30:10.440
It's not safe in Hengtang tonight.

30:10.590 --> 30:11.590
If I'm not around,

30:12.440 --> 30:14.110
you must protect yourself.

30:14.500 --> 30:21.740
♪ Red plums bear dewdrops,
bright and serene ♪

30:21.760 --> 30:25.120
♪ Year by year, time drifts along ♪

30:24.200 --> 30:25.070
Xie Qingyuan.

30:25.150 --> 30:28.850
♪ Warmth and chill
of mortal meet and part ♪

30:26.590 --> 30:28.920
You've always prided yourself on
being able to see through people, right?

30:28.870 --> 30:35.720
♪ No need to heed the wind's soft whisper
and ask about your return ♪

30:29.720 --> 30:30.920
Why can't you tell

30:32.550 --> 30:34.610
I have no ill intentions towards you?

30:35.790 --> 30:42.910
♪ Wild geese soar through deep clouds,
waiting for the moon to rest ♪

30:37.550 --> 30:38.810
We'll form an alliance

30:39.310 --> 30:40.570
and share weal and woe.

30:42.590 --> 30:43.920
Compared to East Pearls,

30:43.040 --> 30:50.210
♪ Old memories lie heavy,
haunting every dream ♪

30:45.270 --> 30:46.670
it seems you prefer jade.

30:47.960 --> 30:50.110
I do have special feelings for you.

30:50.240 --> 30:54.020
♪ Rises and falls take turns ♪

30:51.070 --> 30:53.200
It depends on whether you agree or not.

30:54.110 --> 30:57.470
♪ Phases of the moon,
unplanned to wax and wane ♪

30:57.600 --> 31:04.950
♪ Count fallen blooms,
yet never count all pains of parting ♪

31:03.400 --> 31:04.460
West of the city...

31:04.970 --> 31:11.420
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

31:05.310 --> 31:06.270
Young Master Pei.

31:06.270 --> 31:07.110
Take me to the west.

31:07.110 --> 31:08.370
I have to find Lord Yan.

31:08.510 --> 31:09.590
The west is dangerous.

31:09.590 --> 31:10.440
Don't act rashly.

31:10.440 --> 31:10.920
No!

31:11.470 --> 31:18.720
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

31:12.160 --> 31:13.820
My family said I must find him.

31:14.440 --> 31:15.370
I have to see him,

31:15.680 --> 31:16.590
dead or alive.

31:16.590 --> 31:17.590
I must see him!

31:18.740 --> 31:22.620
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

31:18.790 --> 31:20.270
If Lord Yan were here,

31:20.550 --> 31:22.480
he wouldn't let you risk your life.

31:22.650 --> 31:25.190
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

31:24.040 --> 31:25.270
-Back off!
-Let us out.

31:25.270 --> 31:26.270
Please let us out.

31:26.270 --> 31:27.160
Back off!

31:27.400 --> 31:28.290
Move back!

31:28.830 --> 31:29.510
Back!

31:31.440 --> 31:32.030
Back!

31:32.160 --> 31:32.790
Back!

31:40.200 --> 31:40.930
You go first!

33:10.810 --> 33:17.360
♪ You, tender yet sharp,
with thorns by your side ♪

33:17.390 --> 33:24.820
♪ Like a dim yet blazing candle ♪

33:24.850 --> 33:28.620
♪ The wind and rain sigh,
the road stretches far ♪

33:28.640 --> 33:32.030
♪ Blossoms drift with streams,
affections softly stir ♪

33:32.050 --> 33:38.880
♪ Half real, half illusion;
one cup of spring awakes me ♪

33:38.910 --> 33:46.560
♪ Burned and released,
held by fate's hand ♪

33:46.580 --> 33:53.950
♪ Greet the soft, mild evening breeze
and homebound sail to land ♪

33:53.980 --> 33:57.770
♪ Slim moonbeams
weave tangled dreams all night ♪

33:57.790 --> 34:01.030
♪ Lonely home boat glides slow
through dark twilight ♪

34:01.050 --> 34:06.930
♪ I walk and gaze; one cup of spring
fades to lingering cheer ♪

34:04.960 --> 34:05.440
Sure.

34:05.680 --> 34:06.750
We have a deal.

34:07.000 --> 34:08.230
When you return to Hengtang,

34:08.230 --> 34:09.489
we'll still meet here.

34:16.800 --> 34:18.600
With me around, don't be afraid,

34:18.880 --> 34:19.739
Little Monkey.

34:34.440 --> 34:34.960
Yan Rui!

34:36.000 --> 34:36.360
Go!

34:38.590 --> 34:39.449
Yan Rui is here!

34:39.550 --> 34:40.150
After him!

34:40.190 --> 34:40.719
Let's go.

35:52.840 --> 35:53.480
After him!

36:54.840 --> 36:55.480
After him!

37:40.110 --> 37:41.230
I am Yan Rui.

37:41.710 --> 37:42.550
If you have the guts,

37:42.550 --> 37:43.320
come at me.

37:43.920 --> 37:44.880
Don't touch her.

37:45.800 --> 37:46.480
Come on!

38:14.400 --> 38:15.230
Good.

38:15.670 --> 38:17.000
What a man.

38:29.190 --> 38:29.800
Attack!

38:37.410 --> 38:41.540
♪ I counted every moment ♪

38:41.560 --> 38:45.650
♪ Memories take root;
the annual rings grow ♪

38:45.670 --> 38:50.190
♪ Who bore the parting wind ♪

38:50.220 --> 38:54.950
♪ And wove it gently into the warmth
of the past? ♪

38:55.060 --> 38:59.150
♪ I honor every scar upon your hand ♪

38:59.170 --> 39:03.560
♪ Through endless nights,
a lone soul wanders this mortal world ♪

39:03.590 --> 39:10.240
♪ Turning back, we embrace—
one fleeting moment of love and hate ♪

39:10.310 --> 39:13.930
♪ As flowers fall beneath the dusk ♪

39:13.960 --> 39:19.470
♪ Sorrowed by many a farewell,
comforted by sweet memories ♪

39:19.500 --> 39:22.670
♪ One life, one love,
one heart devoted to you ♪

40:00.070 --> 40:01.530
Lord Yan ordered me to come

40:01.630 --> 40:03.560
to borrow troops from the Marquis.

40:10.190 --> 40:10.720
Marquis.

40:11.590 --> 40:13.120
You two share the same goal.

40:13.480 --> 40:15.190
One person can't accomplish it alone.

40:15.190 --> 40:16.390
If you work together,

40:16.960 --> 40:19.230
you might just win.

40:19.920 --> 40:21.320
It depends on whether you

40:21.880 --> 40:23.610
are willing to take the gamble.

40:39.510 --> 40:40.710
Kill!

40:42.400 --> 40:43.590
Kill!

40:49.440 --> 40:56.960
Kill!

41:47.880 --> 41:48.360
Sister.

41:48.840 --> 41:50.170
I found Healing Powder,

41:50.190 --> 41:50.920
Bletilla Decoction,

41:50.920 --> 41:51.710
and spirits.

41:52.070 --> 41:52.670
Thank you.

41:55.670 --> 41:57.270
Lord Yan is so badly injured,

41:57.360 --> 41:58.560
can he still be cured?

42:02.920 --> 42:03.880
Definitely.

42:05.710 --> 42:07.400
I've studied medicine for so long

42:07.400 --> 42:09.110
so that the people around me

42:09.400 --> 42:10.670
won't leave me again.

42:15.550 --> 42:16.080
I believe

42:16.360 --> 42:17.110
Lord Yan

42:17.280 --> 42:18.230
is blessed by heaven.

42:18.230 --> 42:19.830
He will definitely recover.

42:21.960 --> 42:22.560
Thank you.

42:25.320 --> 42:26.280
I'll get back to work.
